# PRIVATE MATERIAL. NEVER PUSH THESE.
# Once you fill in the kit, the files below contain private material: your clients' words,
# names and figures from call transcripts, the lines mined from those calls, your post
# numbers, your settings and your review pages. They must never be pushed to GitHub or any
# other public place. If you put your copy on GitHub at all, make the repository private.
#
# Note: git keeps tracking a file it already tracks, even once it is listed here. Before
# your first commit, run `git status` and check none of these paths is listed.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
